OL,3,ATwo Latvian men arrested on suspicion
OL,4,Aof trespass at RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two men, who the Met Police said
OL,7,Flived in the UK and were aged 36 and
OL,8,F32, were arrested inside the base
OL,9,Fperimeter.
